#: crates/setup/src/main.rs
msgid ""
"Explorer 2.0 {0} is installed.\n"
"\n"
"You'll find it in the Start menu under “Explorer 2.0”. To uninstall, use “Settings → Apps” or the Start menu entry “Explorer 2.0 – Windows-Standard wiederherstellen”.\n"
"\n"
"Start it now?"
msgstr ""
"Explorer 2.0 {0} está instalado.\n"
"\n"
"Lo encontrarás en el menú Inicio como “Explorer 2.0”. Para desinstalarlo, usa “Configuración → Aplicaciones” o la entrada del menú Inicio “Explorer 2.0 – Windows-Standard wiederherstellen”.\n"
"\n"
"¿Iniciarlo ahora?"

#: crates/integrate/src/bin/explorer2-recover.rs
msgid "Explorer 2.0 – restore the Windows default"
msgstr "Explorer 2.0 – restaurar la configuración predeterminada de Windows"

#: crates/integrate/src/bin/explorer2-recover.rs
msgid ""
"Explorer 2.0 – restore the Windows default\n"
"\n"
"  explorer2-recover                  shows the state, asks and resets\n"
"  explorer2-recover --yes            resets without asking\n"
"  explorer2-recover --status         only shows the state (exit code 1 = active)\n"
"  explorer2-recover --uninstall      resets and removes Explorer 2.0\n"
"  explorer2-recover --uninstall --quiet   the same without asking\n"
"\n"
"Removes all Windows integrations of Explorer 2.0 (folder verbs, Win+E,\n"
"context menu, environment variables, shortcuts …) and restores the previous\n"
"values exactly. Values that other software has changed meanwhile stay\n"
"untouched. Your settings (%APPDATA%\\Explorer2) are kept when uninstalling."
msgstr ""
"Explorer 2.0 – restaurar la configuración predeterminada de Windows\n"
"\n"
"  explorer2-recover                  muestra el estado, pregunta y restablece\n"
"  explorer2-recover --yes            restablece sin preguntar\n"
"  explorer2-recover --status         solo muestra el estado (código de salida 1 = activo)\n"
"  explorer2-recover --uninstall      restablece y quita Explorer 2.0\n"
"  explorer2-recover --uninstall --quiet   lo mismo sin preguntar\n"
"\n"
"Quita todas las integraciones de Explorer 2.0 en Windows (verbos de carpeta, Win+E,\n"
"menú contextual, variables de entorno, accesos directos …) y restaura exactamente\n"
"los valores anteriores. Los valores que otro software haya cambiado entretanto\n"
"no se tocan. Tu configuración (%APPDATA%\\Explorer2) se conserva al desinstalar."

